So the design docs within each weapon are not exactly super accurate and more just ideas to pull from.
The ai makes super flowery language out of what i state, and in some cases ive also given it more control over the content of the design because i had no ideas.
Now the current designs have hard dependencies with upgrades, and im not a big fan of that.
I would much more prefer soft or no depenedencies at all on other upgrades, rather than having many.
In one case being the Pesticide upgrade, rather than making new upgrades to support it, make its stats able to be modified by existing upgrades.

